Package: steelseries-linux
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, udev
Description: Linux configuration CLI for supported SteelSeries devices
 SteelSeries Linux provides native userspace configuration for supported
 SteelSeries hardware. It currently supports DPI, polling rate, battery
 status, physical-device discovery, and endpoint selection for the
 SteelSeries Aerox 3 Wireless Gen 2.

Package: steelseries-linux-gui
Architecture: any
Depends: steelseries-linux (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libfontconfig1, libwayland-client0, libxkbcommon0, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxrandr2
Description: Graphical application for SteelSeries Linux
 SteelSeries Linux GUI provides an optional graphical interface for the
 steelseriesctl JSON API. Device access and validation remain in the
 steelseries-linux backend package.
